{"id":"97247865fbd81e78","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-witness-closure.md","title":"ZFC Witness Closure","display":"df-zfc-witness-closure — ZFC Witness Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-witness-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-witness-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-witness-closure — ZFC Witness Closure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch09/58-df-elementary]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-witness-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-witness-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-witness-closure — ZFC Witness Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary\">../batch09/58-df-elementary</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (set-coded first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structure and substructure candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (Tarski--Vaught predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary\">../batch09/58-df-elementary</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WitnessClosure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WitnessClosure}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}witness\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WitnessClosure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}witness\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WitnessClosure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the typed Tarski–Vaught witness condition: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> must first be a substructure in the same language, and every existential formula with parameters from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> must have a witness in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-elementary]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)$ (Tarski--Vaught predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-elementary]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WitnessClosure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}witness\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WitnessClosure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false}],"bytes":1059,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3868","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-witness-closure.md|58-df-zfc-witness-closure]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e91c1261e1c2374b"]}